WEBVTT


00:01:12.948 --> 00:01:14.495
Benedict.


00:01:14.658 --> 00:01:15.784
Is this true?


00:01:19.288 --> 00:01:21.006
You have found the boy?


00:01:22.332 --> 00:01:23.379
Yes.


00:01:25.627 --> 00:01:26.719
He's not safe here.


00:01:26.878 --> 00:01:28.880
Nonsense, this is a fortress.


00:01:29.047 --> 00:01:30.640
The full resources of the Order...


00:01:30.799 --> 00:01:32.267
...are at our disposal.


00:01:33.969 --> 00:01:34.936
Respectfully...


00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:38.725
...Benedict, the devil himself
wants this child.


00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:41.268
Only one place is safe.
That is the Sanctuary.


00:01:41.435 --> 00:01:42.857
The Rider must take him.


00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:44.613
You do enjoy your wine, Moreau.


00:01:45.314 --> 00:01:46.486
In a few days...


00:01:46.648 --> 00:01:50.027
...the winter solstice will be past
and with it the hour of the prophecy.


00:01:50.193 --> 00:01:52.116
Then the boy will be
of no use to anyone.


00:01:52.904 --> 00:01:53.826
By that time...


00:01:53.989 --> 00:01:55.115
...brother...


00:01:55.324 --> 00:01:56.917
...you will all be dead.


00:01:58.285 --> 00:02:00.253
This conversation is finished.


00:02:18.055 --> 00:02:19.102
They're inside!


00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:52.506
Go!


00:02:55.967 --> 00:02:56.763
Nadya!


00:02:59.971 --> 00:03:00.688
I can help you!


00:03:01.932 --> 00:03:03.354
Damn it. Danny!


00:03:03.725 --> 00:03:05.727
I can protect you!


00:03:18.865 --> 00:03:20.242
Where are they?


00:03:21.993 --> 00:03:23.620
Shut up!


00:03:31.169 --> 00:03:31.920
Perfect.


00:03:54.317 --> 00:03:55.569
Who is this guy?


00:04:09.499 --> 00:04:10.967
Screw this.


00:04:15.088 --> 00:04:15.759
Duck!


00:04:41.072 --> 00:04:43.541
It doesn't matter how far you run.


00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:47.204
There are some demons
you just can't escape.


00:04:47.412 --> 00:04:49.130
My name is Johnny Blaze.


00:04:51.374 --> 00:04:53.126
I rode a motorcycle for a living.


00:04:53.293 --> 00:04:54.795
I did a bare-ass, 360...


00:04:54.961 --> 00:04:57.680
...triple backflip
in front of 22, 000 people.


00:04:59.382 --> 00:05:02.101
It's kind of funny.
It's on YouTube. Check it out.


00:05:02.344 --> 00:05:04.722
But when my dad got sick...


00:05:04.888 --> 00:05:07.812
...I did something
way crazier than that.


00:05:13.313 --> 00:05:15.566
You look like you could
use a little help.


00:05:15.941 --> 00:05:17.534
Are you willing to make a deal...


00:05:18.944 --> 00:05:19.695
...John?


00:05:20.779 --> 00:05:22.076
Attaboy.


00:05:22.531 --> 00:05:23.282
Do it.


00:05:23.448 --> 00:05:24.199
Save his life.


00:05:25.116 --> 00:05:25.787
Do it!


00:05:25.951 --> 00:05:30.627
Yeah, that is right. I'm the guy
who made the deal with the devil.


00:05:30.789 --> 00:05:32.132
I know what you're thinking.


00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:36.761
Doesn't this kid watch movies?
Does this ever work out line?


00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:40.470
Let's just say good judgment
was not exactly my forte.


00:05:40.632 --> 00:05:43.476
I was possessed by
an ancient demon.


00:05:43.802 --> 00:05:47.523
In the presence of evil,
I change into a monster...


00:05:47.681 --> 00:05:49.024
...and I prey...


00:05:49.224 --> 00:05:50.316
...on the wicked...


00:05:50.475 --> 00:05:53.604
...and I suck out their souls.


00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:55.943
And you don't wanna be around
when that happens.


00:05:56.106 --> 00:05:58.825
See, there 's good and bad in all of us.


00:05:58.984 --> 00:06:00.702
And maybe you're not a murderer...


00:06:00.861 --> 00:06:04.661
...but you did something
you wouldn 't want the Rider to see.


00:06:04.823 --> 00:06:08.043
A white lie, an illegal download.


00:06:09.077 --> 00:06:11.876
What about you? And you?


00:06:12.914 --> 00:06:15.963
I've tried to fight it, to hold it back...


00:06:16.251 --> 00:06:20.802
---but the darkness inside me
only gets stronger.


00:06:21.423 --> 00:06:22.970
That's why I had to run...


00:06:23.925 --> 00:06:26.144
...halfway across the world.


00:06:29.139 --> 00:06:30.231
And I'm still running.


00:06:53.288 --> 00:06:55.211
Who are you?


00:06:55.373 --> 00:06:57.421
My name is Moreau.
My brothers are dead...


00:06:57.584 --> 00:07:02.090
...as should I be,
if not for the intervention of God.


00:07:05.717 --> 00:07:06.934
And you are John Blaze.


00:07:07.385 --> 00:07:09.387
Go away.


00:07:13.308 --> 00:07:15.106
I can't do that.


00:07:31.868 --> 00:07:32.710
It likes...


00:07:32.869 --> 00:07:33.791
...the dark places.


00:07:33.954 --> 00:07:36.002
I don't know what you're talking about.


00:07:38.708 --> 00:07:39.379
The Rider.


00:07:46.925 --> 00:07:49.474
You thought that you could control it.


00:07:49.928 --> 00:07:52.397
Make it work for you, huh?


00:07:52.555 --> 00:07:54.273
That you were stronger...


00:07:54.432 --> 00:07:57.151
...than this deep, hungry thing?


00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:58.152
This...


00:07:58.395 --> 00:07:59.317
...sickness.


00:08:01.022 --> 00:08:01.818
Why are you here?


00:08:02.315 --> 00:08:02.986
What do you...


00:08:03.149 --> 00:08:04.651
...want from me?


00:08:05.193 --> 00:08:08.572
I need your help
and you need your soul.


00:08:08.863 --> 00:08:11.036
So we make a deal.


00:08:11.199 --> 00:08:13.918
You know about making deals,
don't you, Johnny?


00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:20.133
Nice bike.


00:08:24.879 --> 00:08:26.301
This Child.


00:08:27.799 --> 00:08:30.222
He is in danger...


00:08:30.385 --> 00:08:32.479
...and for more than his life.


00:08:32.637 --> 00:08:34.639
You will save him.


00:08:39.602 --> 00:08:40.398
I don't...


00:08:41.271 --> 00:08:44.696
...save people.


00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:50.785
What brought you out here,
Johnny Blaze?


00:08:50.947 --> 00:08:53.450
Thousands of miles
from your place of birth...


00:08:54.993 --> 00:08:56.495
...and your dark rebirth.


00:08:58.288 --> 00:09:00.131
You were brought here for this.


00:09:02.417 --> 00:09:06.467
This little kid,
what makes you think I can find him?


00:09:07.088 --> 00:09:09.932
This man that you met years ago
that put the curse...


00:09:10.091 --> 00:09:11.434
...on you?


00:09:11.718 --> 00:09:13.265
Roarke.


00:09:13.428 --> 00:09:15.430
The devil has many names.


00:09:15.597 --> 00:09:18.726
He is the link that connects you
to this child.


00:09:19.517 --> 00:09:22.691
Let the Rider follow his stench.
It will lead you to the boy.


00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:25.949
You said something about a deal.


00:09:26.232 --> 00:09:29.236
The church of my masters
is an ancient one.


00:09:31.279 --> 00:09:36.536
We are prepared to give to you the
one thing you want the most of this world.


00:09:37.827 --> 00:09:43.084
Bring us the boy,
and we will lift your curse.


00:10:08.775 --> 00:10:09.617
Hello.


00:10:09.901 --> 00:10:11.198
Hi.


00:10:11.736 --> 00:10:16.242
I noticed you were looking at me.


00:10:16.533 --> 00:10:18.535
- Yes?
- Was I?


00:10:21.746 --> 00:10:23.544
Nice suit.


00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:25.462
Oh, thank you very much.


00:10:25.625 --> 00:10:26.968
It's ...


00:10:29.712 --> 00:10:33.216
Are you Roma?


00:10:33.383 --> 00:10:34.851
Gypsy?


00:10:35.009 --> 00:10:36.226
Why do you ask?


00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:38.688
Well, what people say about ...


00:10:38.972 --> 00:10:40.189
What?


00:10:42.642 --> 00:10:44.144
Listen...


00:10:45.562 --> 00:10:48.065
...I am a businessman.


00:10:48.231 --> 00:10:49.403
I have a lot of money.


00:10:49.899 --> 00:10:50.946
Yeah?


00:10:51.109 --> 00:10:52.702
- And ...
- And?


00:10:52.861 --> 00:10:55.330
Hey, Mommy. Where's Daddy?


00:10:56.739 --> 00:10:59.743
- I ... Excuse me.
- No, no, no.


00:10:59.909 --> 00:11:01.035
- It's okay.
- No, really.


00:11:01.202 --> 00:11:02.704
No, really, I ... Yeah.


00:11:02.996 --> 00:11:04.498
Sorry.


00:11:18.928 --> 00:11:21.932
Somebody's gonna have
a lot of explaining to do.


00:11:25.185 --> 00:11:26.937
We won't always have to do this.


00:11:27.103 --> 00:11:28.229
Okay?


00:11:31.399 --> 00:11:33.527
I wanna make a life for you.


00:11:33.902 --> 00:11:35.279
This is a life.


00:11:38.323 --> 00:11:40.166
You know I love you more
than anything.


00:11:40.325 --> 00:11:42.248
I love you too, Mama.


00:12:06.059 --> 00:12:10.439
So many times I've tried to keep the Rider
from coming out, but tonight...


00:12:10.605 --> 00:12:12.198
...I need him.


00:12:33.086 --> 00:12:34.053
Hold on!


00:12:37.131 --> 00:12:37.973
What happened?


00:12:38.967 --> 00:12:40.469
Hold on.


00:13:36.691 --> 00:13:38.364
Stay in and lock the doors.


00:13:44.282 --> 00:13:45.955
Nadya.


00:13:48.202 --> 00:13:48.919
No!


00:13:55.376 --> 00:13:56.127
It's been...


00:13:56.294 --> 00:13:57.716
...a long time, pumpkin.


00:13:57.879 --> 00:13:58.550
Carrigan.


00:13:59.964 --> 00:14:01.762
I see you're still an unbelievable...


00:14:01.924 --> 00:14:02.925
...pain in the ass.


00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:06.478
Look, I got people after
Danny and me...


00:14:06.637 --> 00:14:08.435
...so just let me go.


00:14:08.598 --> 00:14:10.066
Let me go!


00:14:13.019 --> 00:14:15.363
I'm the people after you.


00:14:17.148 --> 00:14:18.024
No!


00:14:20.151 --> 00:14:21.277
Don't touch him!


00:14:21.444 --> 00:14:22.661
Get off!


00:14:28.659 --> 00:14:29.581
Get up.


00:14:44.884 --> 00:14:46.431
Unbelievable.


00:14:47.095 --> 00:14:49.143
Still the fighter.


00:14:50.390 --> 00:14:51.061
Carrigan.


00:14:54.644 --> 00:14:56.772
- Yes?
- Please.


00:14:59.107 --> 00:15:01.155
He's my son.


00:15:01.567 --> 00:15:03.160
I know.


00:15:04.487 --> 00:15:06.285
But he's not mine.


00:15:08.449 --> 00:15:09.416
And part of you...


00:15:09.575 --> 00:15:11.452
...had to know it might
end up like this.


00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:20.487
Well, kill it.


00:17:00.561 --> 00:17:02.359
Hungry.


00:17:03.022 --> 00:17:04.695
Oh, God.


00:17:22.375 --> 00:17:24.048
Slugthrowers, now.


00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:46.907
Don't look at it.


00:18:30.067 --> 00:18:32.570
No!


00:18:46.667 --> 00:18:48.044
Get some.


00:18:52.048 --> 00:18:53.265
Move, now!


00:18:55.259 --> 00:18:56.431
Get him in the car.


00:18:56.594 --> 00:18:57.595
Get in!


00:18:58.304 --> 00:18:59.601
Danny!


00:19:27.375 --> 00:19:30.094
- Oh, you have awake.
- Hi.


00:19:31.212 --> 00:19:34.591
It's funny,
because when you walked in...


00:19:34.757 --> 00:19:36.600
...I thought I was still dreaming.


00:19:37.551 --> 00:19:38.928
You have hallucinate?


00:19:39.095 --> 00:19:41.223
No, no, man, I'm not hallucinating.


00:19:41.389 --> 00:19:43.767
Look, I'm flirting with you.


00:19:43.933 --> 00:19:44.809
You're beautiful.


00:19:48.104 --> 00:19:48.980
Okay.


00:19:49.146 --> 00:19:50.113
Morphine?


00:19:50.272 --> 00:19:51.273
You got any morphine?


00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:53.909
Oh, no, no, morphine,
you already have.


00:19:54.068 --> 00:19:55.445
Dilaudid, Valium? What?


00:19:55.778 --> 00:19:56.870
Your wounds ...


00:19:57.697 --> 00:19:58.414
Very weird...


00:19:58.572 --> 00:19:59.698
...mister.


00:20:01.242 --> 00:20:04.587
The politie want to talk to you
when you wake up. I tell them you wake.


00:20:04.745 --> 00:20:05.416
No!


00:20:06.497 --> 00:20:07.794
Please.


00:20:29.061 --> 00:20:30.529
I'm fine. Let me go!


00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:01.051
Take a piss.


00:21:17.526 --> 00:21:18.698
Carrigan.


00:21:18.861 --> 00:21:22.411
I got your package, but the cost
of doing business with me just went up.


00:21:22.573 --> 00:21:23.825
I don't understand.


00:21:23.991 --> 00:21:25.538
What's not to understand?


00:21:26.035 --> 00:21:29.164
I want more. You understand that?


00:21:29.747 --> 00:21:31.420
We had an agreement, Carrigan.


00:21:31.582 --> 00:21:36.008
Changing the defined terms of an
agreement is something we just don't do.


00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:39.299
You told me to get a kid.
Not a problem.


00:21:39.465 --> 00:21:41.342
I've done that for people before.


00:21:41.759 --> 00:21:44.057
And I have history
with his bitch of a mom...


00:21:44.220 --> 00:21:47.565
...so there's no better guy for the job.
But what you didn't tell me...


00:21:47.723 --> 00:21:50.943
...is that I'd be walking into the middle
of a goddamn horror movie.


00:21:52.895 --> 00:21:53.862
Oh, this is funny...


00:21:54.021 --> 00:21:55.068
...to you?


00:21:55.648 --> 00:21:58.322
Three of my guys got turned
into matchsticks last night...


00:21:58.484 --> 00:22:01.704
...by a dude on a motorcycle
with his head on fire.


00:22:05.825 --> 00:22:06.917
Come again?


00:22:07.076 --> 00:22:09.170
You heard me. I've seen things...


00:22:09.328 --> 00:22:11.877
...weird things, bad things.


00:22:12.039 --> 00:22:14.588
But that thing last night? No.


00:22:14.792 --> 00:22:17.420
- No, no, no.
- Put the boy on the phone.


00:22:19.463 --> 00:22:20.965
Talk.


00:22:21.131 --> 00:22:22.053
Talk.


00:22:22.216 --> 00:22:25.265
Danny, do you hear me?


00:22:26.303 --> 00:22:27.429
I want you to listen...


00:22:27.596 --> 00:22:30.725
...very closely. Listen to me.


00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:57.673
What the hell was that?


00:22:57.835 --> 00:23:02.762
Think of the child as a sort of computer.
You know computers, right?


00:23:02.923 --> 00:23:06.018
I just uploaded a little program.


00:23:06.176 --> 00:23:08.725
A firewall.


00:23:08.888 --> 00:23:13.394
Our friend on the motorcycle won't be
able to sense him now, to track him.


00:23:13.976 --> 00:23:16.024
Of course, he still may be able...


00:23:16.186 --> 00:23:19.190
...to End you,
so I suggest you keep moving-


00:23:22.109 --> 00:23:23.452
Hello?


00:24:22.711 --> 00:24:23.837
Who sent you to find me?


00:24:24.838 --> 00:24:28.388
Is it the devil?
The devil that walks among men?


00:24:29.218 --> 00:24:31.437
Does the devil own you? Answer me!


00:24:32.137 --> 00:24:36.392
The kid, Danny. He's your son?


00:24:39.019 --> 00:24:41.397
Bullets can't hurt you
when you walk with the demon.


00:24:41.563 --> 00:24:43.657
But they'll do
what they're supposed to...


00:24:43.816 --> 00:24:45.159
...right now.


00:24:46.527 --> 00:24:48.404
Tell me why I can trust you.


00:24:49.029 --> 00:24:50.702
You can't.


00:24:51.323 --> 00:24:53.291
But if I don't find your son...


00:24:54.702 --> 00:24:56.079
...I'd just as soon be dead.


00:24:57.538 --> 00:24:58.209
So if you...


00:24:58.372 --> 00:24:59.043
...wanna pull...


00:24:59.206 --> 00:25:00.002
...that trigger...


00:25:02.376 --> 00:25:03.923
...do it.


00:25:05.129 --> 00:25:06.381
Please.


00:25:15.055 --> 00:25:16.602
You tracked us last night.


00:25:18.392 --> 00:25:20.190
Can you do it again?


00:25:22.146 --> 00:25:24.194
I could feel him before.


00:25:24.356 --> 00:25:27.326
I could sense him and then nothing.


00:25:29.528 --> 00:25:33.624
No, no, he's not dead,
he's just blocked.


00:25:39.329 --> 00:25:41.127
But you know something.


00:25:44.168 --> 00:25:45.795
Let's go.


00:25:48.464 --> 00:25:50.967
Yeah, okay, well, let me just
get something straight.


00:25:51.133 --> 00:25:54.603
The guy who kidnapped Danny
and tried to kill you and blew me up...


00:25:55.387 --> 00:25:57.105
...with grenades...


00:25:58.557 --> 00:26:00.685
...you two were like
boyfriend, girlfriend?


00:26:02.728 --> 00:26:06.403
Carrigan was a gunrunner,
a drug dealer, a mercenary.


00:26:06.565 --> 00:26:09.068
I didn't care about that.
I just saw a ticket out.


00:26:09.234 --> 00:26:11.157
Right, okay, and so Danny is...'?


00:26:11.320 --> 00:26:12.993
Danny, what, is Carrigan's son?


00:26:15.074 --> 00:26:15.745
No.


00:26:19.244 --> 00:26:19.915
When you met...


00:26:20.120 --> 00:26:22.464
...the seducer,
he offered you something.


00:26:22.956 --> 00:26:26.551
Yeah. My father's life.


00:26:27.336 --> 00:26:28.804
Shocker, he lied.


00:26:29.213 --> 00:26:31.466
For me, it was only myself.


00:26:33.342 --> 00:26:36.061
It was supposed to be big
for Carrigan, but it went bad.


00:26:36.887 --> 00:26:38.560
I made it out a third-floor window.


00:26:40.057 --> 00:26:41.434
I was choking on my own blood.


00:26:42.851 --> 00:26:44.478
I knew I was gonna die.


00:26:44.853 --> 00:26:47.072
I could feel it.
And that's when he found me.


00:26:47.648 --> 00:26:50.993
You look like you could
use a little help.


00:26:53.695 --> 00:26:55.163
Roarke.


00:26:55.405 --> 00:26:57.908
He promised to take the pain away...


00:26:58.075 --> 00:26:59.702
...to save my life.


00:27:01.787 --> 00:27:04.336
But he asked for something in return.


00:27:06.125 --> 00:27:07.593
A son?


00:27:08.335 --> 00:27:11.134
- Maybe you can never understand.
- No, I get it.


00:27:11.547 --> 00:27:13.641
You're the devil's baby mama.


00:27:14.675 --> 00:27:16.427
I guess that explains why Moreau...


00:27:16.593 --> 00:27:17.970
...Wants...


00:27:18.387 --> 00:27:20.355
...Danny so bad.


00:27:20.514 --> 00:27:22.061
- Moreau?
- Yeah.


00:27:22.224 --> 00:27:24.693
Black, French, alcoholic priest,
a dick. Know him?


00:27:25.894 --> 00:27:28.113
He tried to help us. I didn't let him.


00:27:28.772 --> 00:27:31.400
Well, we're both gonna work
on our decision-making.


00:27:32.484 --> 00:27:33.861
Where you headed?


00:27:34.027 --> 00:27:35.449
Someone I know.


00:27:35.696 --> 00:27:39.417
He does Carrigan's dirty work.
He'll know where to find him.


00:27:45.622 --> 00:27:49.001
Why does the devil walk on earth
in human form anyway?


00:27:49.751 --> 00:27:50.718
I have no idea.


00:27:51.545 --> 00:27:52.967
Maybe he doesn't know either.


00:27:53.130 --> 00:27:53.881
Maybe he just...


00:27:54.339 --> 00:27:56.888
...passes on from body to body...


00:27:57.050 --> 00:27:59.303
...through history,
waiting for the perfect Ht.


00:28:00.637 --> 00:28:01.854
But I know one thing.'


00:28:02.472 --> 00:28:04.566
On Earth, he's weak.


00:28:05.225 --> 00:28:06.568
His powers are limited.


00:28:06.727 --> 00:28:09.071
He needs emissaries...


00:28:09.229 --> 00:28:10.446
...to do his dirty work...


00:28:10.606 --> 00:28:15.112
.-.so he finds them or makes them
using his greatest power:


00:28:15.277 --> 00:28:16.995
The power of..


00:28:18.530 --> 00:28:20.123
...The deal.


00:28:30.584 --> 00:28:32.177
Can I open a window?


00:28:34.713 --> 00:28:36.135
You think you can just talk?


00:28:37.758 --> 00:28:41.729
Your mom thought she could just talk,
until I kicked her little Gypsy face in.


00:29:23.845 --> 00:29:24.596
Grab him.


00:29:34.898 --> 00:29:36.525
Get me-- Get me out of here!


00:29:37.067 --> 00:29:39.069
I told you to stop eating the Twinkies.


00:29:39.236 --> 00:29:41.364
- Get me out of here!
- Get off me.


00:29:43.115 --> 00:29:44.617
Boss!


00:30:10.934 --> 00:30:12.561
Come here.


00:30:12.728 --> 00:30:14.446
Try that again, you little turd ...


00:30:17.065 --> 00:30:17.987
What?


00:30:18.358 --> 00:30:20.235
Dude, what happened?


00:30:20.402 --> 00:30:21.995
You speak English?


00:30:22.154 --> 00:30:23.155
Yeah. What happened?


00:30:23.822 --> 00:30:25.039
Is that your van?


00:30:28.243 --> 00:30:30.245
- Yeah.
- Does it run?


00:30:30.412 --> 00:30:31.834
Yeah.


00:31:05.864 --> 00:31:06.786
When we get...


00:31:06.948 --> 00:31:10.703
...where we're going,
the Rider's going to come out.


00:31:11.328 --> 00:31:13.046
And when he does...


00:31:14.206 --> 00:31:17.801
...he'll destroy whoever's got it coming.


00:31:19.044 --> 00:31:22.093
Nadya, this thing...


00:31:23.298 --> 00:31:26.928
...there's no reason, no conscience...


00:31:27.094 --> 00:31:29.438
...just hunger.


00:31:31.098 --> 00:31:32.099
In his eyes...


00:31:34.684 --> 00:31:37.062
...you're no different than Carrigan.


00:31:38.063 --> 00:31:40.111
You're no different than any of them.


00:31:41.858 --> 00:31:43.656
I'm not afraid of you.


00:31:43.819 --> 00:31:46.663
Yeah? Well, you should be.


00:32:03.338 --> 00:32:05.466
That's the guy?
He looks like he works...


00:32:05.632 --> 00:32:06.929
...on a cruise ship.


00:32:08.510 --> 00:32:10.137
Am I gonna regret taking you?


00:32:12.472 --> 00:32:14.850
Yeah, probably.


00:32:20.188 --> 00:32:21.405
Count every dollar!


00:32:21.565 --> 00:32:23.283
I don't want these idiots robbing me.


00:32:23.442 --> 00:32:24.443
Everyone's robbing me!


00:32:24.609 --> 00:32:26.236
It makes my balls hurt!


00:32:31.533 --> 00:32:32.534
Hello, Vasil.


00:32:35.996 --> 00:32:36.792
Long time, Nadya.


00:32:37.164 --> 00:32:38.006
You look good.


00:32:38.165 --> 00:32:40.588
Shut up.


00:32:41.835 --> 00:32:42.961
He's talked to Carrigan.


00:32:43.211 --> 00:32:45.964
The last couple of days
and a few hours ago.


00:32:47.257 --> 00:32:47.928
John?


00:32:50.552 --> 00:32:52.099
You talked to Carrigan?


00:32:52.262 --> 00:32:55.061
I talk to a lot of people.
I got what you need for the shakes...


00:32:55.223 --> 00:32:56.349
...my friend.


00:32:59.269 --> 00:33:00.612
Carrigan must've told you...


00:33:00.770 --> 00:33:03.740
...about that thing that killed
his men last night. Yeah?


00:33:03.899 --> 00:33:04.695
That thing...


00:33:04.858 --> 00:33:06.781
...is inside of me. See...


00:33:06.943 --> 00:33:11.039
...you're a bad man and this thing,
the Rider, he feeds on bad men.


00:33:11.198 --> 00:33:13.997
And he's hungry. He's hungrier
than he's been in years.


00:33:14.159 --> 00:33:16.287
That's why I'm shaking!
Because right now...


00:33:16.453 --> 00:33:19.457
...the only thing standing
between you and the Rider is me.


00:33:19.623 --> 00:33:21.796
And he's just-- He's--


00:33:23.835 --> 00:33:26.054
He's scraping at the door.
Scraping...


00:33:26.213 --> 00:33:26.964
...at the door!


00:33:30.842 --> 00:33:31.889
If you don't tell me...


00:33:32.052 --> 00:33:35.181
...what I wanna know,
I'm gonna let him out.


00:33:39.392 --> 00:33:43.442
And when he's done with you, there won't
be anything left, do you understand?


00:33:43.605 --> 00:33:47.109
Do you understand?
Shake your head yes or no. Good.


00:33:47.275 --> 00:33:48.572
Good girl.


00:33:48.735 --> 00:33:50.203
Where's Carrigan?


00:33:52.155 --> 00:33:54.249
I want the kid! The kid Carrigan has!


00:33:54.407 --> 00:33:55.533
You will tell me...


00:33:55.700 --> 00:33:58.374
...or I will eat your stinking soul!


00:33:58.537 --> 00:34:01.882
The quarry. For more guns, more men.
He's putting together...


00:34:02.040 --> 00:34:04.213
...a goddamn army.
- I know the place.


00:34:05.085 --> 00:34:07.258
You won't mention this
conversation to anyone?


00:34:07.420 --> 00:34:09.172
No, no, no.


00:34:09.339 --> 00:34:11.512
Yeah. All right, well,
that was a good answer.


00:34:12.425 --> 00:34:13.267
- Yeah, good.
- John.


00:34:15.971 --> 00:34:18.394
We gotta go. We gotta go, we gotta go.


00:35:40.513 --> 00:35:44.438
FGM-148 Javelin.


00:35:44.601 --> 00:35:47.480
Lock on, fire and forget.


00:35:51.358 --> 00:35:52.735
American bunker buster.


00:35:53.652 --> 00:35:54.869
Two-stage detonation.


00:35:55.320 --> 00:35:56.788
The first creates...


00:35:56.946 --> 00:35:58.414
...a super vacuum.


00:35:58.573 --> 00:36:00.575
It sucks the oxygen from the air.


00:36:02.661 --> 00:36:04.584
- The next--
- I know what it does.


00:36:04.746 --> 00:36:06.965
Give me four of them,
with extra heads.


00:36:08.083 --> 00:36:09.756
How many men you go up against?


00:36:10.543 --> 00:36:12.011
Just one.


00:36:18.802 --> 00:36:20.679
Danny?


00:36:20.845 --> 00:36:22.973
- Mom?
- Are you okay?


00:36:23.973 --> 00:36:27.648
I'm so sorry. I'm so sorry.
I'm gonna get you out of here.


00:36:32.232 --> 00:36:34.155
- What?
- I think my ankle's broken.


00:36:34.317 --> 00:36:36.069
Come on, hold on.


00:36:56.256 --> 00:36:56.927
Oh, no.


00:37:03.638 --> 00:37:05.515
Come on, hold onto me.


00:37:07.225 --> 00:37:08.568
Showtime.


00:37:09.394 --> 00:37:10.646
Hey!


00:37:17.193 --> 00:37:18.490
What is it?


00:37:19.195 --> 00:37:20.367
I don't care.


00:37:21.030 --> 00:37:21.906
Give me that thing.


00:37:22.073 --> 00:37:23.620
- Give it to me.
- Now.


00:37:46.264 --> 00:37:47.561
Shit!


00:37:50.727 --> 00:37:51.569
That was awesome.


00:38:02.947 --> 00:38:05.120
Reload. Just reload.


00:38:57.293 --> 00:38:58.795
Give me that.


00:39:01.005 --> 00:39:02.222
Okay.


00:39:24.904 --> 00:39:27.202
I'm sorry, did that hurt?


00:39:27.574 --> 00:39:28.541
It looked like...


00:39:28.700 --> 00:39:29.701
...it did.


00:40:50.490 --> 00:40:51.207
Come on.


00:40:51.366 --> 00:40:52.458
Let's go.


00:41:11.552 --> 00:41:12.974
Hurry!


00:41:27.485 --> 00:41:31.080
Sorry. Does it hurt?


00:41:31.489 --> 00:41:33.742
It looks like it does.


00:41:33.908 --> 00:41:36.707
What are you waiting for? Do it! Do it!


00:41:50.675 --> 00:41:51.927
He's coming.


00:42:17.076 --> 00:42:17.918
Let me go.


00:42:28.546 --> 00:42:29.923
Enough.


00:42:31.007 --> 00:42:34.307
Let her go.


00:43:18.554 --> 00:43:21.603
So that happened.


00:43:49.293 --> 00:43:50.419
There you go.


00:43:57.301 --> 00:44:02.228
It was a bee. I thought it was
gonna sting your face.


00:44:04.851 --> 00:44:06.398
Well, are you feeling better?


00:44:08.437 --> 00:44:10.781
Your leg's all healed, huh?


00:44:10.940 --> 00:44:13.910
Like all by itself.


00:44:14.277 --> 00:44:16.029
That's weird.


00:44:18.030 --> 00:44:19.282
Where's my mom?


00:44:19.657 --> 00:44:21.705
She's gassing up the truck.


00:44:24.495 --> 00:44:27.874
I know that it's a little awkward.


00:44:28.541 --> 00:44:31.795
Me rolling with you guys.
I mean, after everything that you've...


00:44:31.961 --> 00:44:33.463
...been through.
- Dude.


00:44:33.629 --> 00:44:36.223
You're cooler than the guys
she usually hangs out with.


00:44:39.802 --> 00:44:41.349
Hey.


00:44:56.652 --> 00:44:58.404
So, what's next?


00:44:59.447 --> 00:45:02.041
Moreau thinks that the danger
will pass in a few days.


00:45:02.200 --> 00:45:04.043
If we just get Danny someplace safe...


00:45:04.202 --> 00:45:06.296
...a holy place,
where his people can protect us...


00:45:06.454 --> 00:45:07.876
...then we can ride it out.


00:45:08.831 --> 00:45:10.253
Okay.


00:45:10.416 --> 00:45:14.091
I've already contacted Moreau.
He's gonna catch up with us on the road.


00:45:17.465 --> 00:45:22.096
We gotta move fast because the ones
who are hunting us, they're not done.


00:45:24.722 --> 00:45:28.147
Plus, I have some personal issues
I'd kind of like to get fixed.


00:45:39.403 --> 00:45:41.622
You're not done, Carrigan.


00:45:42.490 --> 00:45:45.209
You were to bring me Nadya's son.


00:45:45.910 --> 00:45:48.629
I do expect you to fulfill your obligation.


00:45:50.790 --> 00:45:56.422
S ... S ... S ... Sorry, jackass...


00:45:59.423 --> 00:46:01.300
...but I'm dead.


00:46:05.012 --> 00:46:07.231
Inconvenient.


00:46:55.896 --> 00:46:57.648
What'd you do to me?


00:46:59.317 --> 00:47:01.661
Gave you a second chance.


00:47:02.695 --> 00:47:05.790
You're a little less than alive now.


00:47:08.159 --> 00:47:10.127
But also more.


00:47:11.454 --> 00:47:16.255
You see, I've given you power.


00:47:16.417 --> 00:47:19.387
The power of...


00:47:19.545 --> 00:47:21.513
...decay.


00:47:23.883 --> 00:47:25.851
Of darkness.


00:48:01.337 --> 00:48:04.307
I want that boy, Carrigan.


00:48:05.007 --> 00:48:07.351
Now you've got no...


00:48:07.510 --> 00:48:09.103
...excuses.


00:48:13.557 --> 00:48:14.729
The machine last night?


00:48:15.309 --> 00:48:16.185
Yeah?


00:48:16.352 --> 00:48:18.025
You made it change.


00:48:18.562 --> 00:48:19.484
That's how it works.


00:48:19.647 --> 00:48:22.571
Whatever he rides changes with him.


00:48:23.609 --> 00:48:25.703
And what if he took a taxi?


00:48:28.114 --> 00:48:29.832
I don't know. I don't know. Why?


00:48:29.990 --> 00:48:32.368
Or a roller coaster or a ski lift
or a camel or a--


00:48:32.785 --> 00:48:34.162
Dude.


00:48:35.246 --> 00:48:37.920
What if you have to pee
while you're on fire?


00:48:39.667 --> 00:48:42.841
Oh, it's awesome. it's like a flamethrower,
you know? it's like:


00:49:05.234 --> 00:49:08.784
When you change, when you're him...


00:49:09.864 --> 00:49:11.616
...does it feel good?


00:49:14.410 --> 00:49:15.832
Sometimes.


00:49:16.996 --> 00:49:19.624
What does it mean? Are we just bad?


00:49:20.875 --> 00:49:22.343
No.


00:49:25.004 --> 00:49:28.429
This power that we have
comes from a dark place...


00:49:28.591 --> 00:49:30.889
...but it's not who we are.


00:49:31.385 --> 00:49:32.511
It never will be.


00:49:33.095 --> 00:49:36.019
And we can use it to do good...


00:49:36.182 --> 00:49:37.729
...to help people.


00:49:40.019 --> 00:49:42.067
Like I'm helping you and your mom.


00:49:43.022 --> 00:49:44.274
I know why you're helping.


00:49:45.608 --> 00:49:47.702
She says you wanna get rid of it.


00:49:49.320 --> 00:49:51.243
I can't ever do that.


00:50:00.289 --> 00:50:04.669
Hey, Nadya. I hope you have
finished shooting at me!


00:50:10.049 --> 00:50:11.175
Hey.


00:50:11.634 --> 00:50:13.682
You wanna have some fun?


00:50:30.194 --> 00:50:31.616
Hang on.


00:51:27.293 --> 00:51:29.170
That is so weird.


00:52:20.929 --> 00:52:24.024
So this is it, Moreau's happy place.


00:52:25.392 --> 00:52:26.769
These guys will lift my curse?


00:52:27.686 --> 00:52:29.905
They don't even have shoes.


00:52:46.372 --> 00:52:47.373
Amen.


00:52:47.748 --> 00:52:49.125
Amen.


00:52:59.093 --> 00:53:00.140
You mustn't be afraid.


00:53:01.261 --> 00:53:03.013
It was God that led you here.


00:53:08.352 --> 00:53:09.524
What's up?


00:53:13.941 --> 00:53:15.818
I know. A little...


00:53:15.984 --> 00:53:17.281
...uptight. Not so bad...


00:53:17.444 --> 00:53:19.412
...once you get to know them.


00:53:19.571 --> 00:53:20.242
Now go on.


00:53:21.865 --> 00:53:22.707
They will take...


00:53:22.866 --> 00:53:24.584
...good care of you.
- What about...


00:53:24.743 --> 00:53:25.585
...you two?


00:53:25.744 --> 00:53:30.466
We will join you later. We have some
business to complete between us.


00:53:30.666 --> 00:53:32.168
I made a promise to you, John.


00:53:36.547 --> 00:53:38.720
Why can't he come with us?


00:53:38.882 --> 00:53:40.350
- No!
- Danny.


00:53:41.677 --> 00:53:42.348
Danny...


00:53:42.511 --> 00:53:44.184
...you're safe here.


00:53:44.513 --> 00:53:46.015
We made it.


00:53:46.724 --> 00:53:51.150
The only thing that can hurt
you and your mom now...


00:53:51.311 --> 00:53:53.029
...is me.


00:53:53.355 --> 00:53:55.858
I need to make sure
that will never happen.


00:53:57.317 --> 00:53:58.990
It'll be all right.


00:53:59.862 --> 00:54:01.364
I promise.


00:54:02.322 --> 00:54:03.369
Whatever.


00:54:03.532 --> 00:54:04.704
Come on.


00:54:09.204 --> 00:54:10.376
Are you sure about this?


00:54:13.417 --> 00:54:14.259
Come on.


00:54:16.336 --> 00:54:19.431
- Where are we going?
- To my favorite room.


00:54:20.132 --> 00:54:23.511
If there is one thing
these sons of bitches know...


00:54:23.677 --> 00:54:25.350
...it's wine.


00:54:29.767 --> 00:54:33.146
This bottle would fetch
50,000 euros at an auction.


00:54:35.022 --> 00:54:36.023
Moreau.


00:54:36.190 --> 00:54:37.237
Oh, yeah.


00:54:37.399 --> 00:54:39.868
- What is it?
- It's--


00:54:40.027 --> 00:54:43.998
This thing inside of me.
I'd like to know before we...


00:54:44.865 --> 00:54:46.458
...commence.


00:54:49.828 --> 00:54:53.549
Zarathos was an angel...


00:54:54.708 --> 00:54:56.756
...a Spirit of Justice.


00:55:01.048 --> 00:55:04.097
Sent to protect the world of men.


00:55:04.384 --> 00:55:07.058
But he was tricked...


00:55:08.806 --> 00:55:09.807
...captured...


00:55:11.183 --> 00:55:13.402
...brought down to hell...


00:55:14.102 --> 00:55:15.354
...corrupted.


00:55:21.276 --> 00:55:22.118
Driven insane.


00:55:26.907 --> 00:55:30.332
His mission to protect the innocent
was perverted...


00:55:30.494 --> 00:55:32.542
...into a lust to punish...


00:55:32.704 --> 00:55:33.796
...the guilty.


00:55:33.956 --> 00:55:35.424
He became...


00:55:36.667 --> 00:55:38.965
...the Spirit of Vengeance.


00:55:39.545 --> 00:55:43.470
Yeah, but the angel,
the Spirit of Justice...


00:55:43.632 --> 00:55:45.134
...he's alive in there?


00:55:45.926 --> 00:55:47.724
Somewhere?


00:55:47.886 --> 00:55:49.684
He could be.


00:55:52.224 --> 00:55:53.851
Do you feel him?


00:55:59.857 --> 00:56:01.279
No.


00:56:04.152 --> 00:56:07.873
Cheer up, my man.
Soon you will be free.


00:56:08.699 --> 00:56:10.701
This bottle ...


00:56:12.578 --> 00:56:17.049
This one is over 2000 years old.


00:56:17.708 --> 00:56:20.131
I've had my eye on it for a while.


00:56:24.756 --> 00:56:25.928
When this is over...


00:56:29.094 --> 00:56:30.892
...we will share it, huh?


00:56:34.308 --> 00:56:35.981
There's something else.


00:56:38.020 --> 00:56:41.741
This thing that Roarke has done to you
is not easily undone.


00:56:43.400 --> 00:56:45.118
You risk death.


00:56:46.612 --> 00:56:48.285
Worse than death.


00:56:53.285 --> 00:56:54.207
You must confess...


00:56:55.329 --> 00:56:59.800
...the one thing that is most difficult
for you to talk about.


00:57:15.849 --> 00:57:17.271
My dad.


00:57:18.810 --> 00:57:20.653
I didn't do it for him.


00:57:22.564 --> 00:57:24.612
I made the deal for me.


00:57:27.527 --> 00:57:29.279
I couldn't let him go.


00:57:30.739 --> 00:57:32.833
It was selfish.


00:57:34.993 --> 00:57:37.212
He was ready to die.


00:57:38.205 --> 00:57:40.207
He knew it was his time.


00:57:41.124 --> 00:57:43.047
And I thought I could change that.


00:57:45.253 --> 00:57:46.675
I'm sorry.


00:57:56.723 --> 00:58:00.523
This is the lamb of God...


00:58:00.686 --> 00:58:04.782
...that takes away all the sin
from the world.


00:58:06.650 --> 00:58:09.824
Happy are those
that are called to receive him.


00:58:12.364 --> 00:58:14.617
You say that you're not worthy
to receive him.


00:58:14.783 --> 00:58:15.909
I'm not.


00:58:16.076 --> 00:58:18.329
Okay, that's good enough.


00:58:20.622 --> 00:58:22.374
The body of Christ.


00:58:24.626 --> 00:58:25.798
Amen.


00:58:30.215 --> 00:58:34.220
You've been carrying this bread
around for a while.


00:58:37.597 --> 00:58:42.854
May God lead you
into the eternal life.


00:58:43.228 --> 00:58:48.234
That is, John, if today is,
in fact, your last.


00:58:50.569 --> 00:58:54.199
Where you go now, I cannot follow.


00:58:54.698 --> 00:58:56.325
Are you ready?


00:59:03.206 --> 00:59:04.207
Hello?


00:59:08.086 --> 00:59:09.258
Hello?


00:59:11.131 --> 00:59:11.802
Hey.


00:59:25.353 --> 00:59:27.026
Merry Christmas, you assholes!


00:59:32.694 --> 00:59:33.365
Make the deal.


01:00:19.407 --> 01:00:20.954
Moreau!


01:00:21.952 --> 01:00:23.295
Moreau!


01:00:25.205 --> 01:00:26.923
Moreau!


01:00:27.124 --> 01:00:28.671
Moreau!


01:00:29.543 --> 01:00:31.216
You did it!


01:00:33.463 --> 01:00:35.465
Moreau!


01:00:37.717 --> 01:00:39.435
Moreau!


01:00:41.096 --> 01:00:42.643
It worked.


01:00:42.806 --> 01:00:44.934
No! Let me go!


01:00:45.100 --> 01:00:46.226
Help me!


01:00:47.435 --> 01:00:49.403
- Hey! What are you doing?
- Get off me!


01:00:50.564 --> 01:00:52.066
Let me go!


01:00:53.650 --> 01:00:55.118
What are you doing?


01:00:56.736 --> 01:00:58.363
What will be done.


01:01:02.033 --> 01:01:03.910
The day of prophecy is tomorrow.


01:01:04.077 --> 01:01:07.422
We were to hold the boy
until the danger passes.


01:01:07.581 --> 01:01:10.084
The danger will not pass, Moreau.


01:01:10.250 --> 01:01:11.923
As long as the boy exists...


01:01:12.961 --> 01:01:13.757
...the power...


01:01:13.920 --> 01:01:16.014
...will always be inside him.


01:01:20.260 --> 01:01:21.762
You lied to me.


01:01:21.928 --> 01:01:23.475
You lied to me!


01:01:24.306 --> 01:01:26.775
This child must be destroyed.


01:01:26.933 --> 01:01:27.855
No!


01:01:28.435 --> 01:01:29.982
No!


01:01:30.145 --> 01:01:34.366
You might have protested
while the child was being conceived.


01:01:34.900 --> 01:01:38.074
Now it is too late.


01:01:46.161 --> 01:01:47.913
Take them away...


01:01:48.079 --> 01:01:49.626
...until the thing is done!


01:01:52.209 --> 01:01:53.381
Go!


01:01:53.877 --> 01:01:57.177
Danny's soul can still be saved!


01:01:57.339 --> 01:02:00.092
That boy is one of God's children!


01:02:00.425 --> 01:02:01.927
No!


01:02:03.511 --> 01:02:05.263
He is not.


01:03:15.583 --> 01:03:16.800
Pretty neat, huh?


01:03:32.809 --> 01:03:34.231
Peace, brother.


01:03:50.660 --> 01:03:52.287
Damn.


01:03:53.580 --> 01:03:55.924
Bet you're happy to see me.


01:04:23.318 --> 01:04:24.570
Did Danny do this?


01:04:24.986 --> 01:04:27.990
No. Somebody got here
before they could--


01:04:28.156 --> 01:04:29.908
Before they could kill him.


01:04:30.075 --> 01:04:31.952
There's no sign of him.


01:04:32.118 --> 01:04:33.415
Whoever did this wanted...


01:04:33.578 --> 01:04:35.080
...him alive.
- I think we all...


01:04:35.246 --> 01:04:37.999
...have a pretty good idea
who that would be, Moreau.


01:04:38.375 --> 01:04:39.342
Yeah. So now he's...


01:04:39.501 --> 01:04:41.970
...with Roarke.
Some protectors you turned out to be.


01:04:42.295 --> 01:04:44.639
What exactly does Roarke
have in mind for Danny?


01:04:44.798 --> 01:04:48.598
What are his plans for his son? ls he
putting money away for college? What?


01:04:49.552 --> 01:04:50.474
It is the day...


01:04:50.637 --> 01:04:51.980
...of prophecy.


01:04:52.597 --> 01:04:54.895
As was the day Danny was conceived.


01:04:55.642 --> 01:04:57.394
The child must be in his 13th year...


01:04:57.560 --> 01:05:00.234
...before the rite can be performed
on the dawn of winter.


01:05:00.605 --> 01:05:01.731
The rite.


01:05:03.942 --> 01:05:07.663
Roarke fathered the boy as a vessel,
as a container for his power.


01:05:07.821 --> 01:05:10.745
The ritual will transform his essence...


01:05:10.907 --> 01:05:13.251
...his soul into the boy.


01:05:13.660 --> 01:05:15.583
There will be no more Danny.


01:05:16.204 --> 01:05:17.922
- Only Roarke.
- No!


01:05:18.081 --> 01:05:20.300
- Why the hell didn't you tell us this?
- Hey.


01:05:20.458 --> 01:05:22.426
You made a deal with Roarke!


01:05:22.585 --> 01:05:26.055
Both of you!
Something I would never do.


01:05:26.214 --> 01:05:28.933
The prophecy had to happen
at the dawn of a new day.


01:05:29.092 --> 01:05:30.435
Maybe there's still time.


01:05:30.593 --> 01:05:32.891
- Do you know where Roarke has him?
- I think so.


01:05:33.096 --> 01:05:34.894
What, so now you want to play hero?


01:05:35.306 --> 01:05:37.354
You got what you wanted.


01:05:37.684 --> 01:05:39.812
Yes, I did.


01:05:40.228 --> 01:05:42.526
Thank you for holding up
your end of the bargain.


01:05:42.730 --> 01:05:44.232
You're welcome.


01:05:44.441 --> 01:05:45.863
If I can spend my last day...


01:05:46.025 --> 01:05:47.948
...as a free man without a curse...


01:05:48.111 --> 01:05:49.488
...over my head, I'll take it.


01:05:50.363 --> 01:05:52.240
But I promised Danny he'd be safe.


01:05:52.991 --> 01:05:54.789
And if I walk away now...


01:05:54.951 --> 01:05:57.374
...I'm just trading
one demon for another.


01:05:58.204 --> 01:05:59.421
So let's go.


01:06:28.318 --> 01:06:30.366
- Was there ever any doubt?
- Don't...


01:06:30.528 --> 01:06:31.950
...touch me.


01:06:32.113 --> 01:06:34.866
Cutting it a bit close, aren't we?


01:06:38.870 --> 01:06:40.167
You have any idea...


01:06:40.830 --> 01:06:43.208
...what I had to go through...


01:06:44.584 --> 01:06:45.881
...to get this little turd?


01:06:48.755 --> 01:06:49.677
Look...


01:06:49.839 --> 01:06:53.309
...the planets don't align for your
pagan party until daybreak tomorrow.


01:06:53.468 --> 01:06:57.098
So get off my ass
because I'd say I'm ahead of schedule.


01:07:00.225 --> 01:07:01.397
Danny.


01:07:03.311 --> 01:07:06.861
Do you know who I am?


01:07:08.441 --> 01:07:11.285
Well, I'm sure your mother told you...


01:07:11.444 --> 01:07:13.412
...a lot of things about me.


01:07:14.197 --> 01:07:15.790
What's the matter with your face?


01:07:22.789 --> 01:07:26.214
Uzak Gokten.
The farthest point from heaven.


01:07:26.709 --> 01:07:31.465
That is where the ritual is to take place,
according to the prophecy, of course.


01:07:32.173 --> 01:07:33.595
Of course.


01:07:33.758 --> 01:07:37.558
Without the Rider, we stand
very little chance against Roarke.


01:07:37.720 --> 01:07:39.347
You were supposed to have faith.


01:07:39.514 --> 01:07:40.857
I do.


01:07:41.015 --> 01:07:44.895
But also,
I think we should have weapons.


01:07:47.272 --> 01:07:48.569
Guns...


01:07:48.731 --> 01:07:50.074
...and wine.


01:07:51.150 --> 01:07:52.823
Naughty priests.


01:07:54.028 --> 01:07:56.451
I'm starting to like you again, Moreau.


01:08:00.660 --> 01:08:03.584
You wanted to know
why I look this way.


01:08:07.375 --> 01:08:08.718
Think of...


01:08:09.377 --> 01:08:10.754
...a flamethrower.


01:08:18.928 --> 01:08:20.646
Is that funny?


01:08:23.099 --> 01:08:24.817
Okay.


01:08:24.976 --> 01:08:28.731
A flamethrower
made out of papier-méché.


01:08:30.940 --> 01:08:32.192
All that...


01:08:32.358 --> 01:08:33.905
...power.


01:08:34.611 --> 01:08:37.410
But try to use it, you burn up.


01:08:38.489 --> 01:08:40.708
This body I'm living in...


01:08:40.867 --> 01:08:44.497
...it's weak, human.


01:08:45.496 --> 01:08:47.339
It's dying.


01:08:48.124 --> 01:08:51.594
It was never made to do
the things that I can do.


01:08:51.753 --> 01:08:53.300
But you...


01:08:54.672 --> 01:08:57.551
...you're only part human.


01:08:57.717 --> 01:09:01.472
You have all the power
that I have inside of you.


01:09:02.639 --> 01:09:04.733
Like father, like son.


01:09:04.891 --> 01:09:06.063
But this...


01:09:06.225 --> 01:09:07.101
...corporeal...


01:09:07.268 --> 01:09:08.736
...form...


01:09:08.895 --> 01:09:12.945
...can wield the power
without burning itself up.


01:09:22.158 --> 01:09:22.875
To help you...


01:09:23.034 --> 01:09:23.705
...relax.


01:09:34.170 --> 01:09:37.424
That will keep him sedated
until the ceremony.


01:09:52.897 --> 01:09:54.194
Who are they?


01:09:54.941 --> 01:09:57.911
Politicians, murderers,
people of influence.


01:09:58.861 --> 01:10:00.909
The devil's soldiers.


01:10:01.406 --> 01:10:03.408
They've traveled
from all over the world...


01:10:03.574 --> 01:10:06.293
...to witness the anointing
of the new king.


01:10:06.452 --> 01:10:08.045
The new king.


01:10:09.330 --> 01:10:10.673
Please.


01:10:10.832 --> 01:10:12.584
If Roarke succeeds...


01:10:12.750 --> 01:10:16.380
...he'll have a new form,
one more powerful than he's ever known.


01:10:16.754 --> 01:10:20.725
And a shadow will fall upon the earth.


01:11:07.430 --> 01:11:08.352
Twenty-five...


01:11:08.514 --> 01:11:10.858
...30 men. More inside.


01:11:11.017 --> 01:11:12.644
The ritual has already begun.


01:11:12.935 --> 01:11:15.188
Danny's soul will be lost forever...


01:11:15.354 --> 01:11:19.075
...at the break of dawn.
This is when Roarke is at his weakest.


01:11:22.987 --> 01:11:24.455
Nadya?


01:11:33.915 --> 01:11:35.588
You all right?


01:11:43.591 --> 01:11:46.185
I've made a lot of mistakes, Blaze.


01:11:46.844 --> 01:11:47.845
But Danny ...


01:11:52.725 --> 01:11:54.819
Danny's the one ...


01:11:55.895 --> 01:11:58.068
The one good thing...


01:12:00.316 --> 01:12:02.114
...I ever did.


01:12:03.110 --> 01:12:06.956
Well, that being the case...


01:12:07.114 --> 01:12:11.164
...we had better make sure he doesn't
turn out to be the Antichrist.


01:12:59.917 --> 01:13:01.919
Okay. Not much time.


01:13:02.086 --> 01:13:03.212
What's the plan?


01:13:03.379 --> 01:13:06.223
Plan is you go, you grab the boy,
you run and you don't stop.


01:13:06.883 --> 01:13:08.055
What about you?


01:13:09.343 --> 01:13:12.893
Me? I'm going through the front.


01:13:14.724 --> 01:13:16.021
Okay.


01:13:21.230 --> 01:13:21.981
Not bad.


01:13:26.027 --> 01:13:29.156
This might be good on a salad.


01:13:30.448 --> 01:13:31.199
Johnny Blaze!


01:13:37.079 --> 01:13:38.080
Go.


01:13:50.176 --> 01:13:51.598
Catch this one, huh?


01:13:54.555 --> 01:13:56.683
What a waste of good wine!


01:15:09.171 --> 01:15:10.343
That felt good.


01:15:19.015 --> 01:15:19.937
Come on.


01:15:35.865 --> 01:15:37.287
Danny, listen to me.


01:15:37.450 --> 01:15:39.373
I shouldn't have gotten rid
of the power.


01:15:39.535 --> 01:15:41.082
I know that now.


01:15:41.245 --> 01:15:42.622
He's gonna erase you, Danny.


01:16:03.601 --> 01:16:04.773
Moreau.


01:16:09.315 --> 01:16:11.864
I can still see the light!


01:16:25.164 --> 01:16:26.632
That's gross.


01:16:27.291 --> 01:16:29.589
You have no power, Blaze.


01:16:30.377 --> 01:16:32.095
You're nothing but an insect...


01:16:32.630 --> 01:16:34.348
...like the rest.


01:16:34.673 --> 01:16:35.845
Food for the mills...


01:16:36.008 --> 01:16:37.351
...of hell.


01:16:47.269 --> 01:16:50.864
No.


01:16:51.023 --> 01:16:52.366
Not yet.


01:17:12.044 --> 01:17:13.170
Oh, you wanna watch?


01:17:18.801 --> 01:17:21.725
The apple doesn't rot far from the tree!


01:17:24.807 --> 01:17:26.024
Danny.


01:17:29.061 --> 01:17:32.440
This is not who you are.


01:17:34.859 --> 01:17:35.530
It never...


01:17:35.693 --> 01:17:37.070
...will be.


01:17:41.240 --> 01:17:44.961
My powers and yours are the same.
That's what you said.


01:17:46.453 --> 01:17:47.625
Right?


01:17:48.247 --> 01:17:49.794
Dad?


01:17:50.749 --> 01:17:52.922
Like father, like son.


01:18:13.355 --> 01:18:14.902
Do it.


01:18:21.488 --> 01:18:23.365
No!


01:21:48.862 --> 01:21:49.704
Come here.


01:22:36.785 --> 01:22:37.957
Enough!


01:23:05.689 --> 01:23:08.067
I was never afraid of you.


01:23:30.923 --> 01:23:32.266
Roadkill.


01:24:53.046 --> 01:24:54.719
You!


01:24:56.008 --> 01:25:00.388
Worst fucking deal I ever made.


01:25:08.604 --> 01:25:10.356
Go home.


01:25:52.981 --> 01:25:54.699
Danny!


01:27:18.233 --> 01:27:19.109
The angel.


01:27:20.819 --> 01:27:21.615
Moreau...


01:27:21.778 --> 01:27:26.124
...said that the Rider
was an angel that went crazy.


01:27:28.326 --> 01:27:29.578
I can feel him...


01:27:30.537 --> 01:27:32.130
...the angel.


01:27:35.208 --> 01:27:37.336
I can feel him.


01:27:51.433 --> 01:27:53.026
Danny?


01:27:53.518 --> 01:27:55.111
Danny?


01:27:59.608 --> 01:28:00.951
Did we win?


01:28:04.905 --> 01:28:06.532
I'm gonna say yes.


01:28:09.201 --> 01:28:11.124
Hell, yes.


01:28:13.747 --> 01:28:16.500
My name is Johnny Blaze.


01:28:18.835 --> 01:28:20.428
I'm the Ghost Rider.

